id: wikipedia-keyboard-zoom
section: Scrolling and gestures
item: Desktop Wikipedia keeps its layout and its fit zoom when the keyboard comes and goes (T-569: a repeated size or the keyboard's put a page's declared 1120 px width back to the card's 768 and the zoom to 1.0)
shells: enyo mochi mojo
page: https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/HP_TouchPad
kit: cavekit-mochi-ui.md R6
needs: internet
wait rect 'sel:input[name="search"]' 60
wait still 0,100,756,700 20
expect zoom 0.69 0.06
calibrate 'sel:#firstHeading'
tap 'sel:input[name="search"]'
expect keyboard up 8
wait still 0,100,756,500 6
expect zoom 0.69 0.06
chrome kb-hide
expect keyboard down 8
wait still 0,100,756,700 6
expect zoom 0.69 0.06
expect text-has 'sel:#firstHeading' TouchPad
